---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
import { DIGUP_UI, SITE } from '../../lib/site';
---
<Layout
  title="Digup Run — 下载本地多模态语义文件搜索"
  description="下载 Digup Run（Mac / Windows / Linux）。本地 EmbeddingGemma 2 搜索照片、PDF、音频、视频与可选代码。安装包来自 ylwl1997/digup-run-app Releases，本站不托管二进制。"
  canonicalPath="/"
  lang="zh"
  ogImage={DIGUP_UI.hero.src}
>
  <main>
    <section class="hero wrap">
      <div class="hero-split">
        <div class="hero-copy">
          <span class="badge">Digup Run · digup.run</span>
          <h1>用自然语言描述，在本机把文件「挖」出来。</h1>
          <ul class="job-steps" aria-label="Digup Run 怎么用">
            <li><span class="n">1</span> 描述</li>
            <li class="arrow" aria-hidden="true">→</li>
            <li><span class="n">2</span> 命中内容</li>
            <li class="arrow" aria-hidden="true">→</li>
            <li><span class="n">3</span> 打开到页 / 时刻 / 行</li>
          </ul>
          <p class="lede">
            <strong>Digup Run</strong> 是本地优先的多模态语义文件搜索桌面应用。
            自然语言找的是照片、PDF、文档、录音、视频（以及可选代码）里的<strong>内容</strong>——只索引你选的文件夹。
            基于 DigUp（MIT）衍生；<strong>非</strong>官方 DigUp 产品。
          </p>

          <div class="download-grid" aria-label="下载 Digup Run">
            <a class="dl-card" href={SITE.appReleasesLatest} rel="noopener noreferrer">
              <span class="dl-os">Mac</span>
              <span class="dl-meta">Apple Silicon · macOS 14+</span>
              <span class="dl-cta">下载 DMG →</span>
            </a>
            <a class="dl-card" href={SITE.appReleases} rel="noopener noreferrer">
              <span class="dl-os">Windows</span>
              <span class="dl-meta">x64 · Win 10/11 · 测试版</span>
              <span class="dl-cta">下载安装包 →</span>
            </a>
            <a class="dl-card" href={SITE.appReleases} rel="noopener noreferrer">
              <span class="dl-os">Linux</span>
              <span class="dl-meta">.deb · AppImage · amd64 · 测试版</span>
              <span class="dl-cta">下载软件包 →</span>
            </a>
          </div>
          <p class="hero-brew muted">
            安装包仅来自
            <a href={SITE.appReleases} rel="noopener noreferrer">ylwl1997/digup-run-app Releases</a>
            ——本站从不托管二进制。安装指南：
            <a href="/zh/install-mac/">Mac</a> ·
            <a href="/zh/install-windows/">Windows</a> ·
            <a href="/zh/install-linux/">Linux</a>
          </p>
        </div>

        <figure class="shot-panel">
          <span class="shot-label">搜索界面 · Mac（示意）</span>
          <img
            src={DIGUP_UI.hero.src}
            width="1200"
            height="800"
            alt={DIGUP_UI.hero.altZh}
            loading="eager"
            decoding="async"
          />
          <figcaption class="shot-caption">{DIGUP_UI.sourceNoteZh} 查询：「zebra in a video」→ 打开到 0:42。</figcaption>
        </figure>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="wrap section-head">
      <p class="section-label">产品</p>
      <h2>Digup Run 做什么</h2>
      <p class="muted">每次都一样：用你记得的内容描述去搜，然后打开到文件里的位置。</p>
      <div class="scenarios">
        <article class="scenario">
          <span class="mod-pill text">PDF / 文档</span>
          <p class="query-line">the clause about pets in the lease</p>
          <ul class="flow">
            <li><span class="k">找到</span> <span>长 PDF 中的含义匹配</span></li>
            <li><span class="k">打开</span> <span>到对应<strong>页</strong></span></li>
          </ul>
        </article>
        <article class="scenario">
          <span class="mod-pill video">视频</span>
          <p class="query-line">zebra in a video</p>
          <ul class="flow">
            <li><span class="k">找到</span> <span>画面帧 + 音轨窗</span></li>
            <li><span class="k">打开</span> <span>到那一<strong>时刻</strong></span></li>
          </ul>
        </article>
        <article class="scenario">
          <span class="mod-pill audio">音频</span>
          <p class="query-line">where they talk about sleep</p>
          <ul class="flow">
            <li><span class="k">找到</span> <span>约 30 秒语义窗</span></li>
            <li><span class="k">打开</span> <span>到那一<strong>分钟</strong></span></li>
          </ul>
        </article>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="wrap section-head">
      <p class="section-label">模态</p>
      <h2>搜内容，不只是文件名</h2>
      <div class="modality-grid">
        <div class="modality image"><div class="icon" aria-hidden="true">▣</div><h3>图片</h3><p>按画面含义搜照片与截图</p></div>
        <div class="modality text"><div class="icon" aria-hidden="true">¶</div><h3>PDF / 文档</h3><p>页面与段落 → 打开到页</p></div>
        <div class="modality audio"><div class="icon" aria-hidden="true">♫</div><h3>音频</h3><p>~30 秒语义窗 → 时间戳</p></div>
        <div class="modality video"><div class="icon" aria-hidden="true">▶</div><h3>视频</h3><p>帧 + 声音 → 时刻</p></div>
        <div class="modality code"><div class="icon" aria-hidden="true">&lbrace;&rbrace;</div><h3>代码</h3><p>可选 <code>code:</code> → 行</p></div>
        <div class="modality local"><div class="icon" aria-hidden="true">⌂</div><h3>本地</h3><p>只索引你选的文件夹</p></div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="wrap section-head">
      <p class="section-label">指南</p>
      <h2>安装与了解 Digup Run</h2>
      <div class="cards">
        <a class="card" href="/zh/install-mac/"><span class="tag">Mac</span><h3>在 Mac 上安装</h3><p>从我们的 Releases 下载 DMG，首次下模型，⇧⌘Space。</p></a>
        <a class="card" href="/zh/install-windows/"><span class="tag">Windows</span><h3>在 Windows 上安装</h3><p>从我们的 Releases 获取 x64 安装包。</p></a>
        <a class="card" href="/zh/install-linux/"><span class="tag">Linux</span><h3>在 Linux 上安装</h3><p>digup-run 的 .deb 或 AppImage。</p></a>
        <a class="card" href="/zh/what-is-digup/"><span class="tag">概述</span><h3>Digup Run 是什么？</h3><p>模态、索引与系统要求。</p></a>
        <a class="card" href="/zh/faq/"><span class="tag">支持</span><h3>常见问题</h3><p>隐私、Intel Mac、索引耗时等。</p></a>
        <a class="card" href="/"><span class="tag">EN</span><h3>English home</h3><p>Download-first English homepage.</p></a>
      </div>
      <div class="cta-bar">
        <a class="cta" href={SITE.appReleases} rel="noopener noreferrer">GitHub Releases</a>
        <a class="cta-secondary" href={SITE.appRepo} rel="noopener noreferrer">应用源码</a>
        <a class="cta-secondary" href={SITE.upstreamRepo} rel="noopener noreferrer">上游 DigUp（MIT）</a>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>
</Layout>
